  (1, 'VoltageAfrica', 'Intelligent energy infrastructure for Africa.', 'VoltageAfrica is building intelligent renewable energy infrastructure to expand rural electricity access, power productive communities, and connect the future of energy in Africa.', 'mavhimasean@gmail.com', '[{"label":"LinkedIn","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sean-mavhima/"},{"label":"Instagram","url":"https://www.instagram.com/sean_mavhimaa/"},{"label":"Facebook","url":"https://www.facebook.com/sean.mavhima.50/"}]'::jsonb, 'Intelligent energy infrastructure *for Africa.*', '© {year} VoltageAfrica. All rights reserved.', 'Zimbabwe · Rwanda · Kenya', 'Get in touch', '/contact', 'Partner with us', '/partner', 'VoltageAfrica | Intelligent Energy Infrastructure for Africa', 'VoltageAfrica is building intelligent renewable energy infrastructure to expand rural electricity access, power productive communities, and connect the future of energy in Africa.')
